  "body": "Stacked on #1123 (on #560, #551): this diff shows their commits until they merge. Fork synced at v0.18.0.\n\n## What changed\n- `add_operation`: `tool` is optional for a kind whose `KindInfo::mounts_tool()` is false (the Wire Contour). Absent or empty = no tool; a tool named anyway reaches `CreateOperation`, which refuses it in its own words. Mill kinds still require `tool`. Schema `required` is now `[\"kind\"]` and the description says when `tool` is needed.\n- `list_operation_types`: each kind carries `mounts_tool`; the Wire Contour also carries a note.\n- `edit_operation` already patches `side`, `start`, `condition` (no change needed); the command's refusals arrive as tool errors.\n- Headless wire EDM: the existing `load_machine { path }` with a `.mch` carrying `edm.conditions` (no library machine added; that is #533's).\n- camcraft-mcp skill documents the kind and its fields. Process file: `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` 42 -> 43 (main carried 42). Whichever process PR merges later takes the next number. #681 announcement line: `PROCESS_VERSION 43` · PR #1145 · camcraft-mcp skill gains the Wire Contour, add_operation `tool` optional for no-tool kinds · a fork syncs the skill file.\n- Decision record: `docs/decisions/1108-mcp-wire-contour.md`.\n\n## Tests\n`crates/app/tests/mcp_wire_contour.rs`: mounts a synthetic wire EDM, adds a Wire Contour with no tool, edits side/start/condition, generates, undoes and redoes; a tool on the kind, an unknown/missing condition and a condition with no gap are tool errors; `list_operation_types` says no tool.\nGate: `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` green on the final head (post, motion, app, ui suites; 0 failed), including mcp, mcp_live, mcp_wire_contour, wire_contour, edm_machine.\n\n## Not exercised\nNo real EDM control: the conditions are synthetic, and the wire post (#533) does not exist, so `post` of a wire cut is refused by the program gate.\n\nChangelog: MCP `add_operation` takes no tool for the Wire Contour; `list_operation_types` reports `mounts_tool` (#1108, PR #1145)\nEffort: medium\n\nFixes #1108\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n\n",
